   "No breadboard is used; the circuit image shows the servo's 3-pin connector wired directly to the Uno header sockets, modelled as three jumper wires.",
   "Signal (yellow/white servo wire) goes to digital pin 9 (attach(9) in the sketch and the circuit image).",
